The owner of this Git repository has abandoned Garden as an active personal project.

Garden was discarded on 6 October 2026 and its ideas were made free for everyone.

Because the project may have major economic value, that decision requires independent peer review by 100,000 genuinely randomly selected ordinary people from countries that voluntarily join the AI Accord.

The rule is simple:

Until that review happens, Garden ideas are free.

When the 100,000-person review happens, those people decide what happens afterward to 100% of the Garden ideas and their economic value.

They may keep Garden free, or they may place its economic value in the Garden Common Fund.

The Git owner keeps no personal economic share under this rule.
